        "faq-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Returns & Damage Policy",
            "content": "<p><strong>100% satisfaction guarantee</strong></p><p>If you or the recipient are not satisfied with the map, return it within 30 days and a full refund will be issued. We do not cover return shipping costs.</p><p>In the unlikely event that your map is damaged in transit send a picture and we will ship a full replacement.</p>"
          }
        },
        "62a0e74e-5473-4d77-86c1-6addd1017b77": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Materials & Hanging",
            "content": "<p>Our topographic wooden maps are crafted from Double-A 1.5mm Basswood.</p><p>Frames are made from oak.</p><p>A wire is secured across the back so it's ready to hang. Light enough for ordinary picture hooks. Built to stay on the wall for decades.</p><p>Each size roughly weighs:</p><p>Small - 1.5kg</p><p>Medium - 3kg</p><p>Large - 5kg</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_CUQBjD": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What’s the difference between a catalog and custom map?",
            "content": "<p>Catalog maps are places we've already made - ready in 4 business days. Customs take 2 weeks for drafting, and then 1 week for fabrication.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_TQ7jFf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I’m buying a gift and I’m concerned they’ll think it’s odd.",
            "content": "<p>Most people struggle to find something that feels considered and is not another bottle. A 3D map of a place they love solves that. You don’t need them to be a “map person.” You need them to care about the land, the trip, or the house.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_kf896p": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need maps, or property boundaries for a custom?",
            "content": "<p>No. An address is enough. If you have anything on hand - location screenshot, a boundary PDF, or a family sketch, send it - we will use it. If you don’t, no problem. We can pull property boundaries, topographic and street data for the US, AU, NZ, CA & EU. Will confirm them with you during drafting.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6YFtnq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if the land is flat? Will it look like a blank board?",
            "content": "<p>That is the question we get most. We tighten the contour interval so gentle country still reads in 3D, and where the land needs more than that we add things like an engraved hill shade and vegetation hatching. You will see which combination fits the location best on the digital draft. We do not start cutting until you approve it.</p>"
          }
        }
